          "description": "Encode uses FK of each demonstrated seven-joint command. Decode reconstructs the same world TCP translation and rotation before shared damped least-squares IK. The check takes the maximum of FK position error in metres, rotation angle in radians and gripper scalar error. Rotation 6D receives only the declared Gram-Schmidt projection; IK returns its best limit-respecting solution and reports convergence, residuals and limit contacts without silent substitution.",
